    <h1>From 2028 you will see what developers hold over the field next door.</h1>
    <p class="lede">The duty to report sits with the developer, not you. But the public dataset changes your position: you can see who controls neighbouring land, for how long, and when it lapses. So can everyone else, including over your own land.</p>
